# Gravewell Shaft's staked side pit (CIPlay gravewell_shaft_spikes, 11-11 w06; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in
# the recipe: the side pit off the bore's chamber from -15.6 -6.6 down to -17.6 -12.2, stakes at -17.4 -11.8 and
# -16.9 -10.4, the hazard zone gw_spikepit at -17.2 -11.3 (r 1.6, safe=none), the warning sign by the chamber. Into the
# pit: hurt and the message; back up to the chamber: no more harm. Heights are guesses (pit floor ~1).
island Gravewell Shaft keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
expect shown gwspikes

at -16.5 -6 h=3.5
wait 2
read STAKES - KEEP OUT
at -17.2 -11.3 h=1.8
wait 3
expect message staked this pit
expect hurt 4
picture gw_spikes -16 3 -8 -17.4 1 -11.8 light=20
at -16.5 -6 h=3.5
wait 3
expect unhurt
